'''Growing Yellow''' (進化の黄マタタビ, ''Shinka no Ki Matabi'', '''Evolution Yellow Actinidia''') is the [[Catfruit]] gathering daily event of Friday. By clearing any of these stages, you might get a Yellow Catfruit, a Yellow Seed or an Epic Catfruit. You also have a small chance to unlock and play the special stage Catfruit Jubilee. This event was added in [[Version 5.0 Update|Version 5.0]].

